        <item>
            <title>260824.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:25:24 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cxa/yiyan</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/cxa/yiyan/blob/main/RELEASE_NOTES.md</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>2608.24.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>260824.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### What’s improved

- Messages added automatically by Codex or Claude Code, including interruption
  notices and internal task instructions, are no longer saved as your writing.
- The trash menu now lets you remove every failed record without a translation
  at once, while completed and waiting records stay in place.

### 本次改进

- Codex 或 Claude Code 自动加入的中断提示和内部任务内容不再被当作你的文字
  收录，学习记录更加干净。
- 现在可以从垃圾桶菜单一次清除所有没有译文的失败记录；已完成和等待中的
  记录会继续保留。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cxa/yiyan/releases/download/v260824.0/YiYan-260824.0.dmg" length="7914171" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="4e5821LwTEx4JZq225tUf+x3OEQAXcKWD9rhYEhUJXe2jaGowTS0qe2BFST3kqlYhCynhT4XoD68+L9CpnyDCA=="/>
